6
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:16,250
W: Great, in that case we can open a checking account for you very quickly.

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,025
Would you do me a favor and fill out this form?

8
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:22,720
I will also need your identification card with a picture.
